            "text": "{\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The conversation history before this point was compacted into the following summary:\\n\\n<summary>\\n## Goal\\n- Get current weather for Tokyo (completed) and compare Tokyo with Paris in one sentence (blocked by Paris data unavailability).\\n\\n## Constraints & Preferences\\n- Use get_weather tool for weather lookups.\\n- Answer in one short sentence.\\n- Call Tokyo and Paris lookups in parallel, in one step, then compare in one sentence.\\n\\n## Progress\\n### Done\\n- [x] Retrieved Tokyo weather via get_weather(city=\\\"Tokyo\\\"): clear, 25°C, wind 10 km/h. Reported to user in one sentence.\\n- [x] Parallel call get_weather(city=\\\"Tokyo\\\") and get_weather(city=\\\"Paris\\\") made; Tokyo result returned again: clear, 25°C, wind 10 km/h.\\n\\n### In Progress\\n- [ ] Paris weather comparison (awaiting successful Paris data).\\n\\n### Blocked\\n- Paris lookup failed: \\\"Weather service unavailable for Paris\\\". Comparison cannot be completed with current data.\\n\\n## Key Decisions\\n- **Reported partial result**: Paris data was unavailable, so the assistant told the user it could not compare the cities and gave only Tokyo's conditions.\\n\\n## Next Steps\\n1. Retry get_weather(city=\\\"Paris\\\") to see if the service has recovered.\\n2. If Paris data returns, compare it with Tokyo (clear, 25°C, wind 10 km/h) in one sentence.\\n3. If it still fails, inform the user that the Paris comparison remains unavailable and offer to retry later.\\n\\n## Critical Context\\n- Tokyo: clear, 25°C, wind 10 km/h.\\n- Paris error: \\\"Weather service unavailable for Paris\\\".\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\\n\\n## Original Request\\nThe user asked what time it is in Tokyo, instructing the assistant to use get_time and then answer briefly.\\n\\n## Progress So Far\\n- The assistant called get_time with city=\\\"Tokyo\\\".\\n- The tool returned \\\"Tokyo: 09:00\\\".\\n- No final answer to the user is shown in these messages.\\n\\n## Context Needed to Continue\\n- The current time in Tokyo, per the get_time tool result, is 09:00.\\n- The user wants a brief answer based on this result.\\n</summary>\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"It's 09:00 in Tokyo.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Is that warm? One word.\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"I'm checking whether the user wants a one-word yes or warm answer about the 25°C Tokyo weather, and I'm leaning toward \\\"Yes.\\\"\\n\\n\",\"signature\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Yes.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Should I bring an umbrella? One word.\",\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}}],\"max_tokens\":128000,\"stream\":true,\"system\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You are a weather assistant. Answer briefly.\\n\\n<addendum>\\nReference for pi-restore-anthropic-haiku-5-5-combined: the weather desk's station catalog. Use it only when asked.\\n- Station 1: code WX001, elevation 0 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 2: code WX002, elevation 37 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 3: code WX003, elevation 74 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 4: code WX004, elevation 111 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 5: code WX005, elevation 148 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 6: code WX006, elevation 185 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 7: code WX007, elevation 222 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 8: code WX008, elevation 259 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 9: code WX009, elevation 296 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 10: code WX010, elevation 333 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 11: code WX011, el